description: 'Expand store query language (review 12_safety/stores). Current state:
  QueryClause supports Where/Limit/Sort/Take/Skip/Set/Delete (src/ast.rs:532); parsed
  in src/parser (test at parser/tests.rs:621: `Users query / where age >= 18 / limit
  10`). Missing per review: aggregations (count/sum/avg/min/max as query clauses),
  group-by, joins across stores, projections (select subset of fields), and parameterized/compile-time-checked
  query composition. Deliverable: pick the alpha subset (suggest: aggregations + projections;
  defer joins), extend AST QueryClause + parser + typer (compile-time field/type checking
  against store schema is the differentiator) + codegen. Definition of done: conformance
  tests in tests/ pinning each new clause incl. negative tests for unknown-field at
  compile time; jinn.ebnf updated (jinn.ebnf currently has NO query production — fix
  that drift too, see P1-13).'
